1
00:00:15,113 --> 00:00:17,112
(Let's say I like you.)

2
00:00:17,113 --> 00:00:18,113
(Then what should I do?)

3
00:00:18,713 --> 00:00:21,253
(Ryun Gi started to stir feelings in Ro Bin.)

4
00:00:21,483 --> 00:00:22,752
(I thought I had made up my mind.)

5
00:00:22,753 --> 00:00:23,753
(But it's changing a bit.)

6
00:00:23,754 --> 00:00:25,923
(I wanted to follow my heart.)

7
00:00:26,123 --> 00:00:27,292
(It would've been nice if we were together.)

8
00:00:27,293 --> 00:00:30,063
(Seon Ho said some things that clearly expressed his feelings.)

9
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:33,373
(After building their connection based on a sense of certainty...)

10
00:00:34,263 --> 00:00:36,062
(Honestly, all I could see was Seon Ho at that moment.)

11
00:00:36,063 --> 00:00:37,549
(I wanted to go on a date with you from the start.)

12
00:00:37,573 --> 00:00:39,472
(Na Young made a direct move for Seon Ho.)

13
00:00:39,473 --> 00:00:40,473
(Do you want to hold my arm?)

14
00:00:40,474 --> 00:00:41,503
(Can I?)

15
00:00:41,603 --> 00:00:43,119
(A new sense of blossoming excitement)

16
00:00:43,143 --> 00:00:44,503
(An intensifying sense of anxiety)

17
00:00:44,973 --> 00:00:47,482
(Will the date sway his feelings?)

18
00:00:47,483 --> 00:00:48,943
(It made my heart flutter.)

19
00:00:50,913 --> 00:00:52,753
(Come on! What are you doing?)

20
00:00:53,353 --> 00:00:55,753
(The start of a new relationship that may change everything)

21
00:00:56,123 --> 00:00:59,893
(Love Against Time)

22
00:00:59,993 --> 00:01:01,093
Shall we?

23
00:01:02,123 --> 00:01:03,283
You know what? I'm feeling...

24
00:01:03,493 --> 00:01:04,592
How are you feeling?

25
00:01:04,593 --> 00:01:06,163
Are you pleasantly buzzed?

26
00:01:06,563 --> 00:01:07,702
No. I'm just...

27
00:01:07,703 --> 00:01:08,762
Why? Are you pleasantly buzzed?

28
00:01:08,763 --> 00:01:10,803
Yes. Are you not enjoying this?

29
00:01:11,203 --> 00:01:13,603
I'm enjoying it. Of course, I am.

30
00:01:15,203 --> 00:01:16,743
(Staring)

31
00:01:18,273 --> 00:01:20,012
Here's how I feel right now.

32
00:01:20,013 --> 00:01:21,813
So looking at the amount of alcohol we had...

33
00:01:22,743 --> 00:01:25,882
I'd feel about this buzzed after a bottle and a half of soju.

34
00:01:25,883 --> 00:01:27,183
I'm serious.

35
00:01:27,453 --> 00:01:28,453
- Really?
- Yes.

36
00:01:28,454 --> 00:01:30,023
My body can't tolerate makgeolli.

37
00:01:30,483 --> 00:01:31,493
Okay.

38
00:01:31,693 --> 00:01:33,452
- That's a rice-based drink.
- Yes.

39
00:01:33,453 --> 00:01:35,292
- Looking at this...
- You're right.

40
00:01:35,293 --> 00:01:36,422
It's a rice-based drink.

41
00:01:36,423 --> 00:01:38,632
I took a look. "What went into this drink?"

42
00:01:38,633 --> 00:01:42,063
When I looked, it said it contained rice.

43
00:01:42,633 --> 00:01:45,103
So I thought I might not be able to drink a lot of this.

44
00:01:45,333 --> 00:01:46,572
You should stop drinking.

45
00:01:46,573 --> 00:01:47,803
- No.
- Okay.

46
00:01:49,803 --> 00:01:51,072
You're completely fine?

47
00:01:51,073 --> 00:01:53,113
- You're not even buzzed?
- No. I'm perfectly fine.

48
00:01:53,273 --> 00:01:55,033
You can tolerate a lot more alcohol than me.

49
00:01:55,443 --> 00:01:57,042
- Are you feeling good?
- I feel...

50
00:01:57,043 --> 00:01:59,483
- Are you buzzed?
- Yes, I'm a bit buzzed.

51
00:01:59,613 --> 00:02:00,823
- My goodness.
- What?

52
00:02:01,483 --> 00:02:04,022
Oh, my. Did you see that?

53
00:02:04,023 --> 00:02:05,583
- "Are you buzzed?" - "Are you buzzed?"

54
00:02:05,853 --> 00:02:07,023
He was flirting.

55
00:02:08,063 --> 00:02:09,522
I think Seon Ho is...

56
00:02:09,523 --> 00:02:11,632
quite taken with Na Young now.

57
00:02:11,633 --> 00:02:12,633
- He is, right?
- Exactly.

58
00:02:12,634 --> 00:02:13,662
- I agree.
- I think so too.

59
00:02:13,663 --> 00:02:14,962
He was definitely flirting with her.

60
00:02:14,963 --> 00:02:16,232
- He was straight up flirting.
- It would be weird...

61
00:02:16,233 --> 00:02:17,649
- if he wasn't flirting.
- It'd be weird.

62
00:02:17,673 --> 00:02:20,233
- He took out his secret weapon.
- Things could get out of hand.

63
00:02:21,003 --> 00:02:22,472
- Are you feeling good?
- I feel...

64
00:02:22,473 --> 00:02:24,943
- Are you buzzed?
- Yes, I'm a bit buzzed.

65
00:02:25,013 --> 00:02:26,013
I see.

66
00:02:26,014 --> 00:02:27,583
- I'm just buzzed.
- Okay.

67
00:02:29,943 --> 00:02:31,453
It's not showing. So that's good.

68
00:02:32,353 --> 00:02:33,783
But I look exactly the same.

69
00:02:35,223 --> 00:02:37,122
- Really?
- Yes. I look the same.

70
00:02:37,123 --> 00:02:40,452
But let's say I drank about three bottles of this.

71
00:02:40,453 --> 00:02:43,663
Then I'd get a lot more excited than this.

72
00:02:43,863 --> 00:02:45,163
(Glancing over)

73
00:02:48,533 --> 00:02:51,272
Actually... I think I told you before.

74
00:02:51,273 --> 00:02:54,643
So many people around me are heavy drinkers.

75
00:02:55,703 --> 00:02:57,473
(Staring)

76
00:02:59,643 --> 00:03:00,743
- But...
- Yes.

77
00:03:01,413 --> 00:03:02,683
But if I'm being honest,

78
00:03:04,753 --> 00:03:06,213
I do like handsome guys.

79
00:03:06,413 --> 00:03:09,182
Let me explain. I always said,

80
00:03:09,183 --> 00:03:10,352
"I don't like handsome guys."

81
00:03:10,353 --> 00:03:12,093
I used to say that.

82
00:03:12,693 --> 00:03:14,862
I mean, you're handsome.

83
00:03:14,863 --> 00:03:16,963
And you have a beautiful smile.

84
00:03:17,163 --> 00:03:20,033
So I end up smiling with you when I see you smile.

85
00:03:21,203 --> 00:03:23,703
- Thank you.
- So...

86
00:03:24,603 --> 00:03:26,432
So... Shall we?

87
00:03:26,433 --> 00:03:29,943
(She wants to be completely honest with him tonight.)

88
00:03:30,573 --> 00:03:32,293
- That's understandable.
- Isn't this cute?

89
00:03:32,643 --> 00:03:33,713
What?

90
00:03:34,483 --> 00:03:36,183
(An octopus-shaped sausage)

91
00:03:36,583 --> 00:03:38,213
- Sorry.
- It's cute.

92
00:03:43,483 --> 00:03:45,523
I... My gosh.

93
00:03:45,793 --> 00:03:46,923
I'm getting tipsy.

94
00:03:48,893 --> 00:03:52,693
(A night spent smiling just by looking at each other)

95
00:03:53,193 --> 00:03:55,103
- Here's my complete honesty.
- Okay.

96
00:03:56,203 --> 00:03:57,533
So...

97
00:03:58,873 --> 00:04:01,642
I'm saying this because we're drinking together.

98
00:04:01,643 --> 00:04:02,643
Okay.

99
00:04:03,103 --> 00:04:04,712
We all heard the story between you and her.

100
00:04:04,713 --> 00:04:07,313
Your story from six years ago.

101
00:04:08,843 --> 00:04:12,483
This story could belong in a drama or something.

102
00:04:12,753 --> 00:04:14,682
So I thought...

103
00:04:14,683 --> 00:04:16,922
Everyone thought that you two were only interested in each other.

104
00:04:16,923 --> 00:04:20,053
Hearing this kind of speculation...

105
00:04:22,723 --> 00:04:24,933
made me think...

106
00:04:27,333 --> 00:04:31,632
I shouldn't express my interest and complicate things.

107
00:04:31,633 --> 00:04:32,673
Okay.

108
00:04:32,973 --> 00:04:36,143
But then I realized something out of the blue.

109
00:04:36,543 --> 00:04:38,173
- I didn't hear this from you.
- Yes.

110
00:04:38,773 --> 00:04:39,873
So...

111
00:04:40,773 --> 00:04:42,313
I just stopped thinking...

112
00:04:42,883 --> 00:04:44,142
and decided to ask you.

113
00:04:44,143 --> 00:04:45,983
That's why I chose you in the room.

114
00:04:46,153 --> 00:04:48,713
After that, I thought I was quite cool for making this decision.

115
00:04:48,883 --> 00:04:49,953
My gosh.

116
00:04:50,423 --> 00:04:51,723
I mean, you're cool.

117
00:04:51,823 --> 00:04:53,953
I'm really curious. I can't help it.

118
00:04:54,663 --> 00:04:56,663
- Oh, this...
- It's not something I can do alone.

119
00:04:57,393 --> 00:04:59,932
You're right. I was drawn to one person the most...

120
00:04:59,933 --> 00:05:01,063
in the House.

121
00:05:01,163 --> 00:05:02,703
It was fun, and I had a good time.

122
00:05:02,963 --> 00:05:05,303
So I ended up going on another date with her the next day.

123
00:05:05,773 --> 00:05:07,103
I liked the dates with her.

124
00:05:07,133 --> 00:05:09,203
It's true that I feel attracted to her.

125
00:05:09,403 --> 00:05:10,443
And...

126
00:05:12,443 --> 00:05:14,882
people might think that I have my mind made up.

127
00:05:14,883 --> 00:05:17,283
But I'm in the same boat. I'm not certain about my decision.

128
00:05:18,153 --> 00:05:20,393
I want to spend enough time talking to other people too.

129
00:05:21,083 --> 00:05:22,783
- Right.
- We don't have a lot of time.

130
00:05:23,723 --> 00:05:24,753
Actually,

131
00:05:25,523 --> 00:05:27,353
the only person I hadn't talked to yet...

132
00:05:29,023 --> 00:05:31,062
was you, Na Young.

133
00:05:31,063 --> 00:05:32,562
(The only person I hadn't talked to yet was you, Na Young.)

134
00:05:32,563 --> 00:05:33,803
I really wanted to talk to you.

135
00:05:35,133 --> 00:05:36,602
- Hold on.
- Wait.

136
00:05:36,603 --> 00:05:38,333
- Wait.
- Hold on a second.

137
00:05:38,673 --> 00:05:40,232
- "Na Young?" - Isn't she older than him?

138
00:05:40,233 --> 00:05:41,373
She is.

139
00:05:42,203 --> 00:05:43,873
- "Na Young." - "Na Young."

140
00:05:44,273 --> 00:05:45,312
He just went for it.

141
00:05:45,313 --> 00:05:46,313
- Yes.
- Right.

142
00:05:46,413 --> 00:05:47,743
He said it so confidently.

143
00:05:48,343 --> 00:05:50,983
Right. I'm curious as to why he dropped his honorifics.

144
00:05:51,113 --> 00:05:53,453
Is it because she's the only one he's interested in?

145
00:05:55,453 --> 00:05:56,553
Wait.

146
00:05:56,783 --> 00:05:58,453
Se Young. Are you buzzed?

147
00:05:58,853 --> 00:06:00,353
(Bursting into laughter)

148
00:06:01,493 --> 00:06:02,622
Are you buzzed?

149
00:06:02,623 --> 00:06:04,492
(They're feeling buzzed in the studio.)

150
00:06:04,493 --> 00:06:06,333
- Or you're not.
- "Buzzed?"

151
00:06:06,863 --> 00:06:09,333
Both of them are just unstoppable.

152
00:06:09,603 --> 00:06:10,603
(Vroom)

153
00:06:12,733 --> 00:06:14,103
No. Stop drinking.

154
00:06:18,143 --> 00:06:20,313
He just called me by my name, "Na Young."

155
00:06:22,083 --> 00:06:23,642
That made my heart flutter.

156
00:06:23,643 --> 00:06:24,853
My heart raced then.

157
00:06:25,653 --> 00:06:27,982
It made my heart pound. It was heart-fluttering.

158
00:06:27,983 --> 00:06:31,023
Actually, that made me more interested in him.

159
00:06:32,223 --> 00:06:34,723
He's more manly than he looks.

160
00:06:36,123 --> 00:06:37,563
That's why it made my heart flutter.

161
00:06:38,493 --> 00:06:40,432
That's why I thought Ryun Gi was pretty cool at first.

162
00:06:40,433 --> 00:06:41,532
- Me too.
- And...

163
00:06:41,533 --> 00:06:42,902
I thought you were cool too.

164
00:06:42,903 --> 00:06:43,962
(Seon Ho said he needed time to drop his honorifics, )

165
00:06:43,963 --> 00:06:45,579
(but in no time, he wasn't speaking with honorifics.)

166
00:06:45,603 --> 00:06:47,032
That's how I felt.

167
00:06:47,033 --> 00:06:48,043
(Heart racing)

168
00:06:50,743 --> 00:06:52,349
I really liked you after we got a chance to talk.

169
00:06:52,373 --> 00:06:54,383
We laughed so much and shared many stories.

170
00:06:56,483 --> 00:06:58,682
To be honest, I wasn't interested in you at first.

171
00:06:58,683 --> 00:07:00,363
I gradually became more interested in you.

172
00:07:00,413 --> 00:07:01,623
So I wanted us to talk.

173
00:07:03,283 --> 00:07:05,952
Honestly, I'd love to talk to you more.

174
00:07:05,953 --> 00:07:07,023
I see.

175
00:07:07,893 --> 00:07:12,793
(Seon Ho has developed an interest in Na Young.)

176
00:07:15,133 --> 00:07:16,653
What about you? How was today for you?

177
00:07:18,933 --> 00:07:19,933
I...

178
00:07:21,473 --> 00:07:22,603
I'll answer that after this.

179
00:07:25,513 --> 00:07:27,643
(Glancing over)

180
00:07:32,953 --> 00:07:34,553
- Can I drink one more?
- Sure.

181
00:07:35,683 --> 00:07:36,922
- The thing is, - Okay.

182
00:07:36,923 --> 00:07:40,053
I might not look like it, but I do get shy too.

183
00:07:40,293 --> 00:07:41,323
- But...
- So...

184
00:07:47,533 --> 00:07:48,633
I really liked it.

185
00:07:49,133 --> 00:07:50,403
- Really? That's good.
- Yes.

186
00:07:50,863 --> 00:07:51,903
I liked it.

187
00:07:54,943 --> 00:07:57,143
Today's date made my heart flutter for the first time.

188
00:07:57,603 --> 00:08:00,073
(Surprised)

189
00:08:00,213 --> 00:08:02,583
Gosh, this is driving me crazy. This was sudden.

190
00:08:03,413 --> 00:08:04,513
But I mean it.

191
00:08:05,313 --> 00:08:06,412
You made my heart flutter.

192
00:08:06,413 --> 00:08:08,823
(You made my heart flutter.)

193
00:08:09,183 --> 00:08:13,222
(Na Young openly expresses her feelings.)

194
00:08:13,223 --> 00:08:14,393
- What?
- Well,

195
00:08:14,763 --> 00:08:16,483
can I ask you what made your heart flutter?

196
00:08:18,663 --> 00:08:20,863
- It's really random.
- Okay.

197
00:08:20,933 --> 00:08:22,733
- I felt this way twice.
- Okay.

198
00:08:23,433 --> 00:08:24,633
I'm sorry. It was three times.

199
00:08:25,673 --> 00:08:27,302
It happened when I first saw you today.

200
00:08:27,303 --> 00:08:29,243
(It happened when I first saw you today.)

201
00:08:31,943 --> 00:08:34,373
I looked for you for some time, but I couldn't find you.

202
00:08:36,743 --> 00:08:38,213
Then you showed up out of nowhere.

203
00:08:40,083 --> 00:08:42,022
There were so many people at that crosswalk,

204
00:08:42,023 --> 00:08:43,953
but all I could see was you.

205
00:08:46,523 --> 00:08:48,593
My heart fluttered at that moment.

206
00:08:50,523 --> 00:08:51,633
As for the second moment...

207
00:08:52,763 --> 00:08:54,843
Do you remember that moment when it got super windy?

208
00:08:55,033 --> 00:08:57,402
It was such a funny moment.

209
00:08:57,403 --> 00:08:58,403
Yes.

210
00:08:58,404 --> 00:09:00,502
It was the first time ever.

211
00:09:00,503 --> 00:09:02,742
My hair had never been that messy on my first date.

212
00:09:02,743 --> 00:09:04,442
But that was actually...

213
00:09:04,443 --> 00:09:06,242
- It was fun for you.
- Yes.

214
00:09:06,243 --> 00:09:08,442
- That moment was like...
- To be honest...

215
00:09:08,443 --> 00:09:10,312
- a movie poster.
- Yes.

216
00:09:10,313 --> 00:09:12,112
That's right. It was like a scene in a movie.

217
00:09:12,113 --> 00:09:14,882
I thought I'd never be able to forget this moment.

218
00:09:14,883 --> 00:09:15,923
Okay.

219
00:09:18,523 --> 00:09:24,393
(A moment that felt like a scene in a movie)

220
00:09:28,433 --> 00:09:30,662
The third moment was when we were at the N Seoul Tower.

221
00:09:30,663 --> 00:09:31,673
Okay.

222
00:09:31,933 --> 00:09:33,532
I was filming the view. And all of a sudden,

223
00:09:33,533 --> 00:09:35,473
I wanted to record you and turned around.

224
00:09:41,543 --> 00:09:44,283
(The video filmed by Na Young)

225
00:09:51,523 --> 00:09:53,952
That was the third moment my heart fluttered.

226
00:09:53,953 --> 00:09:56,923
(Seon Ho's smile made Na Young smile.)

227
00:09:57,193 --> 00:09:58,893
What? Does it feel weird?

228
00:09:59,563 --> 00:10:01,263
Hearing this is making me shy too.

229
00:10:02,463 --> 00:10:03,702
Imagine how I feel to share this with you.

230
00:10:03,703 --> 00:10:04,933
If anyone's shy, it's me.

231
00:10:12,973 --> 00:10:15,112
It can't be if that's the case.

232
00:10:15,113 --> 00:10:19,553
(Kim Na Young and Kim Seon Ho's date has ended.)

233
00:10:22,553 --> 00:10:25,153
What a bummer. We're almost done with this, though.

234
00:10:25,723 --> 00:10:26,823
One last shot?

235
00:10:27,423 --> 00:10:30,122
(She pours their last shot.)

236
00:10:30,123 --> 00:10:31,462
- We finished it.
- We finished it.

237
00:10:31,463 --> 00:10:32,763
- No way.
- Right.

238
00:10:33,133 --> 00:10:34,333
Last shot?

239
00:10:35,063 --> 00:10:37,433
By the way, do you want to drink more...

240
00:10:38,833 --> 00:10:40,103
in the House?

241
00:10:41,743 --> 00:10:43,073
Really? Okay.

242
00:10:44,773 --> 00:10:46,343
(Shocked)

243
00:10:47,743 --> 00:10:49,442
I really like Na Young's style.

244
00:10:49,443 --> 00:10:51,782
- She's straightforward.
- Yes.

245
00:10:51,783 --> 00:10:53,282
The way she said it was just crazy.

246
00:10:53,283 --> 00:10:55,122
- "Do you want to drink more?" - "Do you want to drink more?"

247
00:10:55,123 --> 00:10:56,923
She doesn't hide her feelings. She's so open.

248
00:10:56,983 --> 00:10:59,452
That way, things can finally get moving.

249
00:10:59,453 --> 00:11:01,252
I think Seon Ho likes that about her.

250
00:11:01,253 --> 00:11:03,623
- Exactly. Seon Ho nodded his head.
- Yes.

251
00:11:03,993 --> 00:11:05,063
Oh, no.

252
00:11:05,563 --> 00:11:06,792
- Oh, my heart.
- That's Na Young's charm.

253
00:11:06,793 --> 00:11:08,632
- Yes.
- Things are getting too wild now.

254
00:11:08,633 --> 00:11:10,303
Alcohol is the problem.

255
00:11:12,073 --> 00:11:13,833
- Seriously. It's a problem.
- It really is.

256
00:11:14,103 --> 00:11:15,223
Do you want to drink more...

257
00:11:16,503 --> 00:11:17,673
in the House?

258
00:11:19,373 --> 00:11:20,643
Really? Okay.

259
00:11:22,583 --> 00:11:25,953
(They set up a secret late-night meeting.)

260
00:11:27,083 --> 00:11:28,422
How do you feel? Do you feel warm enough?

261
00:11:28,423 --> 00:11:30,183
- Yes. It's getting hot now.
- Right?

262
00:11:30,983 --> 00:11:32,323
It was really fun.

263
00:11:38,093 --> 00:11:39,793
(Staring)

264
00:11:42,033 --> 00:11:43,233
Should we go now?

265
00:11:44,263 --> 00:11:45,502
(Shy)

266
00:11:45,503 --> 00:11:46,503
What?

267
00:11:49,903 --> 00:11:50,973
I'm sad to leave.

268
00:11:51,873 --> 00:11:52,873
I want to drink more.

269
00:11:55,083 --> 00:11:56,313
I was feeling good.

270
00:11:56,413 --> 00:11:57,483
Oh, right.

271
00:11:57,583 --> 00:12:01,183
(Their date is over despite their reluctance to end it.)

272
00:12:03,653 --> 00:12:04,653
All right.

273
00:12:05,393 --> 00:12:07,123
I see. No way.

274
00:12:10,893 --> 00:12:11,993
I'm sad it's over.

275
00:12:12,593 --> 00:12:13,663
Me too.

276
00:12:14,463 --> 00:12:18,033
(They head back to the House while still longing for more.)

277
00:12:18,133 --> 00:12:19,203
Do you want some?

278
00:12:22,243 --> 00:12:24,072
- Do you want two?
- What? Yes.

279
00:12:24,073 --> 00:12:25,272
It's small.

280
00:12:25,273 --> 00:12:26,273
(Na Young gives him candy.)

281
00:12:26,274 --> 00:12:27,772
- Is it watermelon-flavored?
- Yes.

282
00:12:27,773 --> 00:12:28,982
- It's so good.
- Right?

283
00:12:28,983 --> 00:12:29,983
Yes.

284
00:12:30,413 --> 00:12:31,753
(Smiling)

285
00:12:31,913 --> 00:12:34,352
- Your face looks red now.
- Yes?

286
00:12:34,353 --> 00:12:36,353
Really? Oh, no.

287
00:12:37,683 --> 00:12:39,422
- You can see it now.
- Yes.

288
00:12:39,423 --> 00:12:40,992
- It's red?
- Yes, it's really red.

289
00:12:40,993 --> 00:12:41,993
- Really?
- Yes.

290
00:12:41,994 --> 00:12:43,393
Come on. This is bad.

291
00:12:43,593 --> 00:12:46,033
What if they think only I drank on the date?

292
00:12:46,133 --> 00:12:47,893
I'll tell them I drank more than you.

293
00:12:49,063 --> 00:12:50,933
(Chuckling)

294
00:12:51,363 --> 00:12:52,832
That sounds weirder.

295
00:12:52,833 --> 00:12:54,302
- Really?
- Is it that red?

296
00:12:54,303 --> 00:12:56,703
(Seon Ho's bold confidence puts Na Young's worries at ease.)

297
00:12:58,073 --> 00:12:59,073
I'm curious, though.

298
00:12:59,873 --> 00:13:02,043
- Be completely honest with me.
- Okay.

299
00:13:03,043 --> 00:13:04,542
Are you interested in me or not?

300
00:13:04,543 --> 00:13:05,553
Am I interested in you?

301
00:13:06,483 --> 00:13:07,589
(A candid question to ask about his feelings)

302
00:13:07,613 --> 00:13:09,252
- Gosh.
- What?

303
00:13:09,253 --> 00:13:11,282
Come on. Tell me. Just say yes or no.

304
00:13:11,283 --> 00:13:13,123
- Just that.
- I became interested in you now.

305
00:13:13,823 --> 00:13:17,922
I want to talk to you more after today's date.

306
00:13:17,923 --> 00:13:20,633
I want to go on another date too.

307
00:13:22,163 --> 00:13:26,073
(He became more curious about her after their first date.)

308
00:13:26,173 --> 00:13:27,703
I'll cut to the chase.

309
00:13:28,273 --> 00:13:29,872
Do you want me to take more initiative?

310
00:13:29,873 --> 00:13:33,542
Or do you want me to give you space...

311
00:13:33,543 --> 00:13:34,673
and see how things go?

312
00:13:35,213 --> 00:13:36,913
Given our circumstances,

313
00:13:37,913 --> 00:13:39,512
I don't think we need to worry about that.

314
00:13:39,513 --> 00:13:40,612
That's just my opinion.

315
00:13:40,613 --> 00:13:42,933
- Really? That's good.
- It doesn't make me uncomfortable.

316
00:13:43,023 --> 00:13:45,653
I just want you to follow your heart.

317
00:13:48,693 --> 00:13:50,223
- I'll be honest then.
- Okay.

318
00:13:51,263 --> 00:13:53,533
I'm not interested in other people.

319
00:13:57,703 --> 00:13:58,773
Am I being too honest?

320
00:13:59,803 --> 00:14:01,372
I just think I should be honest.

321
00:14:01,373 --> 00:14:02,743
Thank you for being honest.

322
00:14:02,843 --> 00:14:05,013
- If I'm being honest, - Yes.

323
00:14:05,673 --> 00:14:08,682
It's true that I did spend more time with someone else.

324
00:14:08,683 --> 00:14:11,403
But it's also true that I now have a lot on my mind after this date.

325
00:14:11,443 --> 00:14:13,783
That actually bothered me a bit when we were drinking.

326
00:14:14,683 --> 00:14:16,259
I realized that I was having a lot of fun.

327
00:14:16,283 --> 00:14:17,403
Were you thinking about her?

328
00:14:17,683 --> 00:14:20,493
If I didn't have fun with you on this date,

329
00:14:20,993 --> 00:14:22,073
I would've made up my mind.

330
00:14:22,763 --> 00:14:23,763
But...

331
00:14:24,693 --> 00:14:27,593
- But that's...
- I had a lot of fun today.

332
00:14:30,503 --> 00:14:31,903
You must have a lot on your mind.

333
00:14:36,073 --> 00:14:37,073
What do I do?

334
00:14:37,273 --> 00:14:39,013
Right. I don't know anyway either.

335
00:14:39,113 --> 00:14:41,312
(Sighing)

336
00:14:41,313 --> 00:14:43,443
My gosh. She just went for it.

337
00:14:43,543 --> 00:14:45,113
After their date tonight,

338
00:14:46,253 --> 00:14:48,452
- she'll only pursue him.
- Definitely. Only him.

339
00:14:48,453 --> 00:14:51,593
I actually don't know which way Seon Ho is going to decide.

340
00:14:51,793 --> 00:14:53,923
But Na Young tried everything she possibly could...

341
00:14:54,023 --> 00:14:55,322
to flirt with him.

342
00:14:55,323 --> 00:14:56,362
- She did everything.
- Totally.

343
00:14:56,363 --> 00:14:58,022
- She did everything.
- I want to applaud her.

344
00:14:58,023 --> 00:14:59,462
- You know what?
- Seriously.

345
00:14:59,463 --> 00:15:00,492
- She's so brave.
- Na Young did it.

346
00:15:00,493 --> 00:15:01,532
- She did it.
- Yes.

347
00:15:01,533 --> 00:15:02,762
- It was the perfect way to put it.
- She...

348
00:15:02,763 --> 00:15:03,862
- Yes.
- She did it.

349
00:15:03,863 --> 00:15:05,232
Seon Ho must have a lot on his mind indeed.

350
00:15:05,233 --> 00:15:06,533
What are they going to do?

351
00:15:06,633 --> 00:15:08,703
I guess we just have to watch how it pans out.

352
00:15:09,273 --> 00:15:10,543
Seon Ho is...

353
00:15:11,303 --> 00:15:12,613
Well, I'm worried about Ye Ji.

354
00:15:12,713 --> 00:15:14,413
Right. I'm worried about Ye Ji.

355
00:15:15,943 --> 00:15:21,183
(He has begun developing an interest in another woman.)

356
00:15:22,653 --> 00:15:26,223
My gosh. One more day... We're done with Day Five.

357
00:15:26,323 --> 00:15:27,323
Yes.

358
00:15:28,563 --> 00:15:31,193
(The House at that time)

359
00:15:32,563 --> 00:15:33,793
Why aren't they home already?

360
00:15:35,133 --> 00:15:37,432
They met up late, didn't they?

361
00:15:37,433 --> 00:15:39,433
Right. They did.

362
00:15:42,443 --> 00:15:46,242
(When Ye Ji is getting tired of waiting, )

363
00:15:46,243 --> 00:15:47,443
- What?
- Can we get out here?

364
00:15:47,713 --> 00:15:49,042
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

365
00:15:49,043 --> 00:15:54,453
(the two of them arrive at the House.)

366
00:15:58,993 --> 00:16:00,353
- What? Okay.
- What?

367
00:16:02,423 --> 00:16:04,862
Seon Ho. Your face is red too.

368
00:16:04,863 --> 00:16:06,033
- Really?
- Yes.

369
00:16:06,693 --> 00:16:09,003
- It was hot. That must be why.
- Oh, no.

370
00:16:09,263 --> 00:16:10,703
What do we do? Wait.

371
00:16:11,103 --> 00:16:12,132
- So what?
- My gosh.

372
00:16:12,133 --> 00:16:13,372
- So what? We did nothing wrong.
- So what? Yes.

373
00:16:13,373 --> 00:16:14,432
- It's okay to drink.
- Drinking is fine.

374
00:16:14,433 --> 00:16:15,472
What's wrong with them?

375
00:16:15,473 --> 00:16:16,802
- Right.
- It's like we did something wrong.

376
00:16:16,803 --> 00:16:17,903
- No way.
- What?

377
00:16:18,313 --> 00:16:19,342
You said my face was red.

378
00:16:19,343 --> 00:16:20,412
I wonder what everyone is up to.

379
00:16:20,413 --> 00:16:21,613
I'm curious.

380
00:16:25,413 --> 00:16:26,413
What?

381
00:16:27,913 --> 00:16:28,952
It was crazy.

382
00:16:28,953 --> 00:16:30,023
Good job.

383
00:16:31,283 --> 00:16:32,552
(Everyone's eyes are on him.)

384
00:16:32,553 --> 00:16:33,853
My gosh, he's back.

385
00:16:37,563 --> 00:16:41,163
(Na Young quickly goes back to her room.)

386
00:16:41,803 --> 00:16:43,862
- She's here!
- She's here!

387
00:16:43,863 --> 00:16:46,633
- Oh, my. You look so pretty today.
- You look so pretty.

388
00:16:47,073 --> 00:16:48,672
- What did you do?
- I drank quite a bit today.

389
00:16:48,673 --> 00:16:50,572
- What?
- I drank a lot.

390
00:16:50,573 --> 00:16:52,013
- Your face is so red.
- Wait.

391
00:16:52,543 --> 00:16:54,173
What? Is it that red?

392
00:16:54,373 --> 00:16:55,612
- Na Young.
- We wanted to drink...

393
00:16:55,613 --> 00:16:58,512
Na Young dressed up to impress today.

394
00:16:58,513 --> 00:16:59,673
What did you do on your date?

395
00:17:00,353 --> 00:17:01,582
(Hesitant)

396
00:17:01,583 --> 00:17:03,752
- Is it a secret?
- No, it's not a secret.

397
00:17:03,753 --> 00:17:06,693
- What did you do?
- No, it's not a secret.

398
00:17:07,523 --> 00:17:10,093
We got on the city tour bus and went to Mount Nam.

399
00:17:11,623 --> 00:17:13,462
- That's crazy.
- Oh, no. I wanted to do that too!

400
00:17:13,463 --> 00:17:15,603
- Mount Nam...
- That was at the top of my list.

401
00:17:15,703 --> 00:17:17,333
(Glancing back)

402
00:17:19,103 --> 00:17:20,332
I'm sorry to do this.

403
00:17:20,333 --> 00:17:23,372
We were on a double-decker. And the roof was done.

404
00:17:23,373 --> 00:17:26,342
I'm sorry, but look. That's how my hair looked.

405
00:17:26,343 --> 00:17:28,742
We kept just laughing at each other.

406
00:17:28,743 --> 00:17:30,013
We were screaming and stuff.

407
00:17:30,843 --> 00:17:31,952
(Feeling dizzy)

408
00:17:31,953 --> 00:17:33,753
Oh, no. What is she going to do?

409
00:17:33,883 --> 00:17:34,983
Oh, no.

410
00:17:36,923 --> 00:17:38,353
I can't watch this.

411
00:17:38,453 --> 00:17:40,452
She went on the date Ye Ji wanted the most.

412
00:17:40,453 --> 00:17:41,992
- It must be agonizing to hear that.
- Right.

413
00:17:41,993 --> 00:17:43,223
I might get indigestion.

414
00:17:43,323 --> 00:17:45,192
Ye Ji is trying to control her emotions too.

415
00:17:45,193 --> 00:17:46,233
- Yes.
- Right.

416
00:17:47,133 --> 00:17:49,403
After that, we went to an izakaya and drank.

417
00:17:49,503 --> 00:17:51,432
- Oh, how I envy you.
- Gosh, I'm so envious.

418
00:17:51,433 --> 00:17:53,803
I want to drink too.

419
00:17:54,033 --> 00:17:57,643
He wanted to drink warm sake. It was my first time having that.

420
00:17:57,873 --> 00:17:59,912
Some people get drunk really fast on sake.

421
00:17:59,913 --> 00:18:02,313
I easily get drunk on makgeolli.

422
00:18:02,683 --> 00:18:03,912
- I can't tolerate...
- Fermented alcohol.

423
00:18:03,913 --> 00:18:04,913
Rice-based drinks well.

424
00:18:04,914 --> 00:18:06,913
I got drunk super fast.

425
00:18:07,453 --> 00:18:08,782
- Right. Your face is so red.
- Right.

426
00:18:08,783 --> 00:18:10,883
When I drink soju, my face rarely gets red.

427
00:18:13,223 --> 00:18:16,793
It was so awkward, so we kept drinking shots together.

428
00:18:19,233 --> 00:18:21,863
Were you able to have a meaningful conversation?

429
00:18:25,803 --> 00:18:28,102
- It was very meaningful.
- That's great news.

430
00:18:28,103 --> 00:18:31,203
I think alcohol definitely helped.

431
00:18:32,113 --> 00:18:34,113
(Blushing)

432
00:18:35,513 --> 00:18:36,713
(Sighing)

433
00:18:37,383 --> 00:18:40,253
I got this hunch. Or was it just my instincts?

434
00:18:40,883 --> 00:18:44,483
There was something about the vibe between them.

435
00:18:44,783 --> 00:18:47,953
The two of them had drinks too.

436
00:18:48,393 --> 00:18:51,293
Seeing her red face made me wonder...

437
00:18:51,893 --> 00:18:55,363
what they talked about. They even drank together.

438
00:18:55,733 --> 00:18:57,863
But still.

439
00:18:58,333 --> 00:18:59,873
He went on three dates with me.

440
00:19:00,273 --> 00:19:02,842
But this was his first date...

441
00:19:02,843 --> 00:19:04,403
with Na Young.

442
00:19:05,913 --> 00:19:10,213
I was worried that he might have enjoyed his date with her more.

443
00:19:10,683 --> 00:19:12,683
They drank together too.

444
00:19:13,053 --> 00:19:16,252
And I hear the night view from the N Seoul Tower is beautiful.

445
00:19:16,253 --> 00:19:20,392
So I thought it would be impossible for a man and a woman...

446
00:19:20,393 --> 00:19:21,723
to develop an interest.

447
00:19:25,663 --> 00:19:26,993
I was worried.

448
00:19:29,163 --> 00:19:30,933
(Pondering)

449
00:19:31,203 --> 00:19:32,672
Why the long face all of a sudden?

450
00:19:32,673 --> 00:19:34,202
I have a lot on my mind.

451
00:19:34,203 --> 00:19:35,243
Tomorrow is our last day.

452
00:19:35,643 --> 00:19:37,042
I'm most curious about your date today.

453
00:19:37,043 --> 00:19:39,773
Didn't you go on a date with Na Young for the first time?

454
00:19:39,873 --> 00:19:41,613
- Yes.
- It was your first date with her?

455
00:19:42,043 --> 00:19:44,512
Wasn't this the first time you guys actually talked?

456
00:19:44,513 --> 00:19:46,183
- It was.
- How was it?

457
00:19:47,353 --> 00:19:49,923
- It was good.
- Oh, that's a positive answer.

458
00:19:50,223 --> 00:19:54,192
It was so good to the point that I was glad that we talked.

459
00:19:54,193 --> 00:19:55,493
I see. That's interesting.

460
00:19:56,423 --> 00:19:58,732
I think this is the first time I'm hearing a positive response...

461
00:19:58,733 --> 00:20:00,763
from you, so this is interesting.

462
00:20:00,863 --> 00:20:02,562
Is this the first positive response?

463
00:20:02,563 --> 00:20:03,563
Yes.

464
00:20:05,103 --> 00:20:06,503
Do you have a lot on your mind?

465
00:20:06,903 --> 00:20:07,903
No.

466
00:20:08,503 --> 00:20:10,673
- Come on. He sounds so moody.
- Right.

467
00:20:11,043 --> 00:20:13,043
He's gotten more introspective after today's date.

468
00:20:14,613 --> 00:20:16,283
I just decided...

469
00:20:17,943 --> 00:20:19,513
to follow my wild side.

470
00:20:20,553 --> 00:20:22,222
- We shouldn't think here.
- Right.

471
00:20:22,223 --> 00:20:24,152
- If we had fun, then we did.
- Right.

472
00:20:24,153 --> 00:20:25,153
If we clicked, then we clicked.

473
00:20:25,153 --> 00:20:26,153
- Totally.
- Yes.

474
00:20:26,154 --> 00:20:28,352
We don't have time to be thorough and check the boxes.

475
00:20:28,353 --> 00:20:30,993
I don't think we should be doing that here.

476
00:20:31,423 --> 00:20:33,592
Either we hit it off, or we don't.

477
00:20:33,593 --> 00:20:34,593
Right.

478
00:20:35,333 --> 00:20:37,762
Besides, check what boxes? This isn't a job interview.

479
00:20:37,763 --> 00:20:40,273
(He decided to follow his heart instead of overanalyzing it.)

480
00:20:40,673 --> 00:20:44,003
(A few moments later)

481
00:20:45,673 --> 00:20:47,613
- What are you doing?
- What?

482
00:20:47,873 --> 00:20:49,953
- What are you doing?
- I'm just listening to music.

483
00:20:50,013 --> 00:20:51,083
I'm not doing anything.

484
00:20:52,753 --> 00:20:53,813
Did you have fun?

485
00:20:53,913 --> 00:20:54,913
We had drinks.

486
00:20:55,323 --> 00:20:58,223
I can see that. Your face says it all.

487
00:20:58,623 --> 00:21:00,122
You must be very happy.

488
00:21:00,123 --> 00:21:01,123
You know...

489
00:21:01,923 --> 00:21:03,063
You guys drank together.

490
00:21:03,493 --> 00:21:05,562
Talking over drinks definitely changes...

491
00:21:05,563 --> 00:21:07,493
- how conversations turn out.
- Okay.

492
00:21:07,863 --> 00:21:08,863
It's much easier to talk.

493
00:21:09,403 --> 00:21:11,003
- Right. Alcohol does that.
- It does.

494
00:21:11,103 --> 00:21:12,432
Yes. It was really nice.

495
00:21:12,433 --> 00:21:14,793
I bet you guys had a great time. The weather was great too.

496
00:21:15,133 --> 00:21:19,013
(Thinking about her date tonight still makes her giddy.)

497
00:21:19,073 --> 00:21:21,113
Have you ever been on one of those city tour buses?

498
00:21:22,413 --> 00:21:23,442
- Never, right?
- No.

499
00:21:23,443 --> 00:21:24,443
It was my first time today.

500
00:21:24,444 --> 00:21:26,812
I always wanted to try that. But I haven't taken it yet.

501
00:21:26,813 --> 00:21:28,482
Should I show you the videos I took?

502
00:21:28,483 --> 00:21:31,083
- Let me see.
- It was so...

503
00:21:32,023 --> 00:21:33,193
unbelievable.

504
00:21:35,993 --> 00:21:37,562
- Look at that.
- Amazing.

505
00:21:37,563 --> 00:21:38,693
It's crazy, isn't it?

506
00:21:39,093 --> 00:21:40,492
The view is amazing.

507
00:21:40,493 --> 00:21:41,963
Show him the one I was in.

508
00:21:44,363 --> 00:21:46,002
- It's crazy.
- Right?

509
00:21:46,003 --> 00:21:48,163
(She shows him the videos that she took with Seon Ho.)

510
00:21:51,003 --> 00:21:52,512
It's a boyfriend-style pic.

511
00:21:52,513 --> 00:21:54,073
No, it isn't.

512
00:21:54,843 --> 00:21:56,513
Do Gon is stuck in the middle.

513
00:21:57,083 --> 00:21:58,383
What's going on?

514
00:21:58,683 --> 00:22:00,852
Those two should drink separately.

515
00:22:00,853 --> 00:22:03,652
- The excitement is still there.
- Right.

516
00:22:03,653 --> 00:22:05,122
- The joy and happiness...
- She wants to tell everyone...

517
00:22:05,123 --> 00:22:06,592
- she meets.
- Right.

518
00:22:06,593 --> 00:22:08,992
But she can't do that in the girls' room.

519
00:22:08,993 --> 00:22:10,163
Right.

